---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="關於我們｜Veloria Diamond Symphony"
  description="Veloria 以專業選品、客製設計、品質承諾與長期陪伴，為每一段珍貴關係打造值得收藏的珠寶作品。"
  canonical="/pages/about-us/"
  image="/assets/brand/brand-logo-primary.png"
>
  <main class="about-page" data-about-page>
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-container">
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">首頁</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span>關於我們</span>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div class="about-hero-stage">
        <figure class="about-hero-mask about-hero-mask-left" data-about-float data-float-depth="-12">
          <img src="/assets/custom-service/veloria-store-display-mask.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <figure class="about-hero-mask about-hero-mask-right" data-about-float data-float-depth="12">
          <img src="/assets/custom-service/service-showcase-01.png" alt="" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>

        <div class="about-container about-hero-copy-shell">
          <div class="about-intro-copy">
            <img class="about-intro-logo" src="/assets/brand/veloria-wordmark.svg" alt="Veloria" data-about-reveal-direction="down" />
            <p data-about-reveal-direction="up">
              <span class="about-brand-script">Veloria</span> <strong>相信，珠寶不只是耀眼的裝飾，</strong><br />
              <strong>而是一段關係、一份承諾與一個人生時刻的凝鍊。</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-container about-origin-grid">
        <div class="about-origin-copy">
          <div class="about-origin-heading">
            <p class="about-origin-number">01</p>
            <p class="about-origin-label">PROMISE</p>
            <h2>以光為名，書寫兩人相遇後的篇章</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="about-origin-body">
            <p>
              <span class="about-brand-script">Veloria</span> 源自「velvet」般柔和的光澤與「gloria」所象徵的榮光，寓意一段愛情在時間中被溫柔照亮。對一對新人而言，珠寶不只是承諾的象徵，更像是一束被收藏起來的光，記錄著相遇、相知，直到決定攜手同行的那一刻。
            </p>
            <p>
              這枚戒指，見證兩人從各自的人生走向同一段旅程，銘記只屬於彼此的幸福時刻。當您看見無名指上的 <span class="about-brand-script">Veloria</span>，便能想起最初相遇時的心動，也想起在眾人祝福下，彼此許下承諾的那一天。
            </p>
            <p>
              <span class="about-brand-script">Veloria</span> 將陪伴二位共度每一個日常與紀念日，讓愛在歲月裡持續閃耀，成為一生中最溫柔而堅定的光。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <figure class="about-origin-sketch" data-about-float data-float-depth="10">
          <img src="/assets/brand/veloria-ring-sketch.png" alt="Veloria 戒指設計手繪稿" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-products-section">
      <div class="about-container">
        <div class="about-service-layout">
          <div class="about-service-feature-row">
            <div class="about-service-side-copy about-service-side-copy-left">
              <div class="about-service-item">
                <h3>專 業 選 品 <span>Curated Selection</span></h3>
                <p>以鑽石火光、比例、淨度與配戴平衡為基準，為每位客人篩選適合日常與紀念時刻的珠寶作品。每一件作品都回到配戴者本身，而不是只追求表面的耀眼。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-service-mask-cluster">
              <figure class="about-service-mask about-service-mask-small about-service-mask-small-left" data-about-float data-float-depth="26" data-float-x-depth="-10" data-float-phase="-0.06" data-float-speed="1.08">
                <img src="/assets/custom-service/veloria-diamond-close-mask.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="about-service-mask about-service-mask-main" data-about-float data-float-depth="-22" data-float-x-depth="7" data-float-phase="0.02" data-float-speed="1">
                <img src="/assets/custom-service/veloria-custom-craft-mask.png" alt="" loading="lazy" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="about-service-mask about-service-mask-small about-service-mask-small-right" data-about-float data-float-depth="28" data-float-x-depth="12" data-float-phase="0.08" data-float-speed="1.1">
                <img src="/assets/custom-service/veloria-pair-ring-hand-mask.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" />
              </figure>
            </div>
            <div class="about-service-side-copy about-service-side-copy-right">
              <div class="about-service-item">
                <h3>客 製 設 計 <span>Custom Design</span></h3>
                <p>從鑽石選擇、戒台線條、手型比例到配戴習慣開始討論，將生活輪廓與審美偏好轉化為專屬設計。過程中保留足夠溝通，讓作品自然承接日常配戴與重要時刻。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-service-statement">
            <div class="about-service-copy">
              <div class="about-service-item">
                <h3>高 規 品 質 <span>Fine Quality</span></h3>
                <p>重視材質、工藝、鑲嵌細節與售後保養，讓珠寶多年後仍保有穩定而細緻的光澤。我們以安靜透明的方式完成每一次選物與製作，讓信任不只停留在購買當下，而能延伸到往後每一次配戴。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-founder-section">
      <div class="about-container about-founder-grid">
        <p class="about-founder-overline" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>FROM HEART</span>
          <span>TO HEIRLOOM</span>
        </p>
        <div class="about-founder-visual">
          <figure class="about-founder-image" data-about-float data-float-depth="-18" data-float-x-depth="6" data-float-phase="0.04" data-float-speed="1.02">
            <img src="/assets/custom-service/veloria-founder-showcase.jpg" alt="Veloria 店內珠寶展示情境照" loading="lazy" />
          </figure>
        </div>
        <div class="about-founder-copy">
          <blockquote class="about-dialogue-quote">
            <span>Founder</span>
            <p>「珠寶最珍貴的地方，是它能把無形的心意，變成可以被長久珍藏的形體。」</p>
          </blockquote>
          <div class="about-founder-body">
            <p>
              <span class="about-brand-script">Veloria</span> 從專業鑽石交易與珠寶設計經驗出發，將嚴謹選品與溫柔溝通放在同等重要的位置。每一次諮詢，都從理解配戴者的生活、喜好與故事開始。
            </p>
            <p>
              我們希望客人感受到的不是銷售壓力，而是一段清楚、安心且值得信任的選物過程。從第一顆鑽石，到日後保養與紀念日禮物，<span class="about-brand-script">Veloria</span> 都願意成為長期陪伴的珠寶顧問。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script>
    const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    const floatItems = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-about-float]'));
    const fadeRevealItems = Array.from(
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(
        [
          '.about-origin-heading > *',
          '.about-origin-body p',
        ].join(', ')
      )
    );
    const entranceRevealItems = Array.from(
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(
        [
          '.about-intro-copy',
          '.about-service-item h3',
          '.about-service-item h3 span',
          '.about-service-item p',
          '.about-founder-overline',
          '.about-founder-overline span',
          '.about-dialogue-quote span',
          '.about-dialogue-quote p',
          '.about-founder-body p',
        ].join(', ')
      )
    );
    const clamp = (value: number, min: number, max: number) => Math.min(Math.max(value, min), max);

    if (!reduceMotion && floatItems.length > 0) {
      let ticking = false;

      const updateFloatItems = () => {
        const viewport = window.innerHeight || document.documentElement.clientHeight;

        floatItems.forEach((item) => {
          const rect = item.getBoundingClientRect();
          const depth = Math.abs(Number(item.dataset.floatDepth || 20));
          const phase = Number(item.dataset.floatPhase || 0);
          const speed = Number(item.dataset.floatSpeed || 1);
          const progress = clamp(((viewport - rect.top) / (viewport + rect.height)) * speed + phase, 0, 1);
          const direction = Number(item.dataset.floatDepth || 20) < 0 ? -1 : 1;
          const xDepth = Number(item.dataset.floatXDepth || 0);
          const offset = (progress - 0.5) * depth * direction;
          const xOffset = (progress - 0.5) * xDepth;
          item.style.setProperty('--about-float-y', `${offset.toFixed(2)}px`);
          item.style.setProperty('--about-float-x', `${xOffset.toFixed(2)}px`);
        });

        ticking = false;
      };

      const requestUpdate = () => {
        if (ticking) return;
        ticking = true;
        window.requestAnimationFrame(updateFloatItems);
      };

      updateFloatItems();
      window.addEventListener('scroll', requestUpdate, { passive: true });
      window.addEventListener('resize', requestUpdate);
    }

    const revealItems = Array.from(new Set([...fadeRevealItems, ...entranceRevealItems]));

    if (reduceMotion || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
      revealItems.forEach((item) => item.classList.add('is-visible'));
    } else if (revealItems.length > 0) {
      document.body.classList.add('about-motion-ready');

      fadeRevealItems.forEach((item) => item.classList.add('about-reveal', 'about-reveal-fade'));
      entranceRevealItems.forEach((item) => item.classList.add('about-reveal', 'about-reveal-entrance'));

      revealItems.forEach((item, index) => {
        item.classList.add('about-reveal');
        item.style.setProperty('--about-reveal-delay', `${Math.min(index * 54, 420)}ms`);
      });

      const syncRevealState = () => {
        const viewportHeight = window.innerHeight || document.documentElement.clientHeight;
        revealItems.forEach((item) => {
          const rect = item.getBoundingClientRect();
          const isVisible = rect.top < viewportHeight * 0.9 && rect.bottom > viewportHeight * 0.08;
          item.classList.toggle('is-visible', isVisible);
        });
      };

      window.setTimeout(() => {
        const revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver(
          (entries) => {
            entries.forEach((entry) => {
              const isVisible = entry.isIntersecting && entry.intersectionRatio > 0.06;
              entry.target.classList.toggle('is-visible', isVisible);
            });
          },
          {
            rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px',
            threshold: [0, 0.06, 0.16],
          }
        );

        revealItems.forEach((item) => revealObserver.observe(item));
        syncRevealState();
      }, 160);
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    background: #ffffff;
    overflow-x: clip;
  }

  .about-page {
    --about-container: min(100% - clamp(32px, 7vw, 128px), 1120px);
    --about-narrow: min(100% - clamp(32px, 8vw, 128px), 680px);
    --about-section-space: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
    --about-ink: #15120f;
    --about-muted: #6f6760;
    --about-soft: #8c8177;
    --about-line: rgba(167, 132, 86, 0.38);
    --about-gold: #aa8454;
    --about-cream: #ffffff;
    --about-warm: #ffffff;
    --about-heading-xl: clamp(28px, 3.2vw, 46px);
    --about-heading-lg: clamp(22px, 2.45vw, 35px);
    --about-heading-md: clamp(18px, 1.5vw, 23px);
    --about-body: clamp(12px, 0.86vw, 14px);
    color: var(--about-ink);
    overflow-x: clip;
  }

  .about-container {
    width: var(--about-container);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-page h1,
  .about-page h2,
  .about-page h3,
  .about-page p {
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .about-page h1,
  .about-page h2,
  .about-page h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .about-page h1 {
    font-size: var(--about-heading-xl);
  }

  .about-welcome-title {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(18px, 3vw, 34px);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .about-wordmark {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    color: #0a3764;
    font-family: var(--font-latin-display);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.86;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .about-wordmark-large {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1em;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .about-wordmark-small {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: -0.055em;
    font-size: 0.62em;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.045em;
  }

  .about-brand-script {
    font-family: var(--font-latin-display), "Cormorant Garamond", "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about-page h2 {
    font-size: var(--about-heading-lg);
  }

  .about-page h3 {
    font-size: var(--about-heading-md);
  }

  .about-page p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--about-muted);
    font-size: var(--about-body);
    line-height: 2;
  }

  .about-page p + p {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: clamp(10px, 1.5vw, 18px) 0 clamp(6px, 1.4vw, 18px);
    color: rgba(21, 18, 15, 0.34);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: inherit;
  }

  .about-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: var(--about-gold);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: clamp(16px, 3.5vw, 48px);
    background: var(--about-cream);
    overflow-x: clip;
  }

  .about-hero-stage {
    position: relative;
    min-height: clamp(250px, 31vw, 390px);
    margin-top: 0;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .about-hero-mask {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 0;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #ffffff;
    opacity: 0.94;
    transform: translate3d(0, var(--about-float-y, 0), 0);
    will-change: transform;
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #000 56%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.86) 74%, transparent 100%);
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #000 56%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.86) 74%, transparent 100%);
    -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat;
    mask-repeat: no-repeat;
    -webkit-mask-size: 118% 118%;
    mask-size: 118% 118%;
    -webkit-mask-position: center;
    mask-position: center;
  }

  .about-hero-mask::after {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28), transparent 18%, transparent 82%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26)),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22), transparent 22%, transparent 80%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24));
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 34px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
    content: "";
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about-hero-mask img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: saturate(0.82) brightness(1.04);
  }

  .about-hero-mask-left {
    left: max(-14vw, -180px);
    bottom: clamp(-92px, -5vw, -42px);
    width: min(34vw, 520px);
    aspect-ratio: 1.58 / 1;
    clip-path: polygon(6% 0, 82% 12%, 100% 72%, 43% 100%, 0 80%);
  }

  .about-hero-mask-left img {
    width: 116%;
    height: 116%;
    object-position: 78% 54%;
  }

  .about-hero-mask-right {
    right: max(-7vw, -100px);
    top: clamp(20px, 4vw, 62px);
    width: min(28vw, 420px);
    aspect-ratio: 1.36 / 1;
    clip-path: polygon(10% 16%, 82% 0, 100% 62%, 54% 100%, 0 70%);
  }

  .about-hero-mask-right img {
    object-position: 52% 50%;
  }

  .about-intro-copy {
    width: min(100%, 560px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-hero-copy-shell {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    min-height: clamp(250px, 31vw, 390px);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about-intro-logo {
    display: block;
    width: clamp(150px, 16vw, 240px);
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(12px, 1.8vw, 22px);
  }

  .about-intro-copy p {
    color: rgba(21, 18, 15, 0.92);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.35vw, 21px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.62;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .about-intro-copy strong {
    font-weight: inherit;
  }

  .about-intro-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .about-hero-frame {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100%, 900px);
    aspect-ratio: 2.72 / 1;
    margin: 0 auto;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #e9e5df;
    transform: translate3d(0, var(--about-float-y, 0), 0);
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .about-hero-frame::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(21, 18, 15, 0.08), rgba(21, 18, 15, 0.16)),
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16), transparent 36%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about-hero-frame img,
  .about-mask-image img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about-hero-frame img {
    filter: saturate(0.62) contrast(0.92) brightness(1.12);
    object-position: 52% 58%;
  }

  .about-hero-frame figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    place-content: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 20px rgba(21, 18, 15, 0.18);
  }

  .about-hero-frame span {
    font-family: var(--font-latin-display);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about-hero-frame strong {
    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.13vw, 17px);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .about-story-section {
    padding: var(--about-section-space) 0;
    background: var(--about-cream);
  }

  .about-artboard {
    position: relative;
    min-height: clamp(520px, 64vw, 760px);
  }

  .about-artboard-tall {
    min-height: clamp(600px, 70vw, 820px);
  }

  .about-centered-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: var(--about-narrow);
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-centered-copy h1,
  .about-centered-copy h2 {
    color: rgba(21, 18, 15, 0.68);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .about-lead {
    margin-top: clamp(14px, 2vw, 24px);
    color: rgba(21, 18, 15, 0.62);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 23px);
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
  }

  .about-rule {
    width: min(100%, 550px);
    height: 1px;
    margin: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 22px) auto clamp(18px, 2.4vw, 30px);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--about-line), transparent);
  }

  .about-rule-left {
    margin-inline: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--about-line), transparent);
  }

  .about-mask-image {
    position: absolute;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--about-warm);
    transform: translate3d(0, var(--about-float-y, 0), 0);
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .about-origin-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.58fr) minmax(280px, 0.42fr);
    gap: clamp(34px, 5vw, 76px);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: clamp(70px, 8vw, 130px);
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .about-origin-copy {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-inline: 0;
  }

  .about-origin-body {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .about-origin-body::before {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    inset: clamp(-12px, -1vw, -6px) clamp(-28px, -3vw, -18px) clamp(-18px, -1.5vw, -10px);
    pointer-events: none;
    content: "";
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 14% 18%, rgba(8, 60, 102, 0.035), transparent 34%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 86% 88%, rgba(20, 28, 36, 0.03), transparent 32%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        rgba(20, 28, 36, 0.08) 0,
        rgba(20, 28, 36, 0.08) 1px,
        transparent 1px,
        transparent 34px
      ),
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68));
    opacity: 0.82;
  }

